@startuml census_tiger
title census_tiger: district, county and place boundaries
start
:list TIGER<year>/<LAYER>/ for the last 3 years
(SLDU, SLDL, CD, COUNTY, PLACE);
note right
  one unit per file kind (29_sldl.zip,
  29_cd119.zip, 29_cd120.zip, us_county.zip...),
  newest vintage first
end note
repeat
  :download the newest candidate;
repeat while (a zip?) is (no: HTML stub, try the previous vintage)
-> yes;
:read shapefile (pyshp);
note right: counties: national file, Missouri (STATEFP 29) only
:census_tiger_features
(properties verbatim + GeoJSON geometry);
:dbt: stg_census_tiger__features -> dim_district
(+ county judicial circuits from the Official Manual)
-> fct_official_districts;
stop
@enduml
